{"id":"5b6e0fc96331c897","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization.md","title":"Effective Irredundant Axiomatization within a Formula Class","display":"df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization — Effective Irredundant Axiomatization within a Formula Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization","aliases":["67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization"],"display":"df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization — Effective Irredundant Axiomatization within a Formula Class","depends_on":["[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"4","source_label":"irredundantly Gamma-axiomatizable","source_printed_pages":"58","source_pdf_pages":"69","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"定义陈述已与原书核对；不涉及定理证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization — Effective Irredundant Axiomatization within a Formula Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"irredundantly Gamma-axiomatizable"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"58"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"69"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"定义陈述已与原书核对；不涉及定理证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为固定公式类；例如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Irred}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Irred}_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a> 及其已声明接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Gamma}_T(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Gamma}_T(U)\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Gamma}_T(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Z\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\n\\mathrm{REAx}(Z)\\land\\mathrm{Ax}_T(Z,U)\\land\\mathrm{Irred}_T(Z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Gamma}_T(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Z\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\n\\mathrm{REAx}(Z)\\land\\mathrm{Ax}_T(Z,U)\\land\\mathrm{Irred}_T(Z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷58页的 i.Γ-a. 明确同时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 递归可枚举、各公理属于所指定的原句法公式类，以及相对不可冗余。它不是仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的每个公理与某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 句在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中等价；如果采用等价闭包，必须另行给出相应形式定义，不能悄然改变本谓词。</p>\n<p>从任意不可冗余化构造得到的蕴涵链会增加公理复杂度；有r.e.的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 公理化且有r.e.不可冗余公理化，并不保证二者能同时实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}$ 为固定公式类；例如 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的 $\\Pi_n$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}_T$、$\\mathrm{Irred}_T$ 与 $\\mathrm{REAx}$ 取 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]] 及其已声明接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Irred}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Gamma}_T(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Gamma}_T(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Z\\subseteq\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\n\\mathrm{REAx}(Z)\\land\\mathrm{Ax}_T(Z,U)\\land\\mathrm{Irred}_T(Z).","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2091,"backlinks":[{"id":"19405805e97916e7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi_n$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]；$\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]；$\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Pi_n}_T$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization]]"}],"outgoing":["d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","851cd80e64893935"]}